  "title": "Velvety Resinous Saudi-Arabian Olives Tagine",
  "description": "This dish is an exotic, flavorful, and aromatic blend of green olives, double-rise-bread, and sweet Saudi spices, perfect for a date night dinner. The velvety texture and resinous flavors are achieved through a unique cooking technique and spice blend.",
