  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the bread cubes and cook until golden brown, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the green olives, date syrup, rose water, cardamom, cinnamon, cumin, and black pepper. Cook for 2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the water and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 10 minutes.",
    "Stir in the chopped parsley and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
